/E (Food is an important part of our identity. In a time when traditional Balti cuisine is slowly being replaced by modern fast food and outside influences, we aim to keep our historical tastes and local recipes alive. Many of our meals are prepared using organic ingredients, seasonal produce, and a farm-to-table approach inspired by village life in Baltistan.)
